---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy - Altis Technology"
  description="Learn how Altis Technology processes personal data, uses cookies, and handles privacy requests."
  canonical="https://www.altis.com.tr/en/privacy/"
  alternateUrl="https://www.altis.com.tr/gizlilik/"
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="privacy-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal Notice</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="hero-meta">Last updated: June 2025 · Prepared with reference to Turkish personal data protection law.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-body section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">

        <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by <strong>Altis Technology Software Consulting</strong> ("Altis", "Company", "we", or "us").
          Personal data may be processed by Altis as the data controller under applicable data protection rules, including Turkish Law No. 6698 on the Protection of Personal Data where relevant.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> Natoyolu Cad. İlkyaz Sok. Kartal Plaza No: 24-28 Kat: 1 D: 1, Ümraniye / Istanbul, Turkey</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@altis.com.tr">info@altis.com.tr</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+902164158255">+90 216 415 82 55</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you visit our website or use our contact forms, the following categories of data may be collected:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> name, surname, email address, phone number, and company name when submitted through a form</li>
          <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, visited pages, and visit duration</li>
          <li><strong>Cookie data:</strong> session cookies and preference cookies, as explained below</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Purposes of Processing</h2>
        <p>Your data may be processed for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Responding to contact requests and managing demo or quotation processes</li>
          <li>Providing website functionality and security</li>
          <li>Creating anonymous usage statistics to improve our services</li>
          <li>Complying with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Legal Basis</h2>
        <p>Personal data may be processed based on the following legal grounds:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Processing necessary for establishing or performing a contract, such as responding to contact requests</li>
          <li>Legitimate interests of the data controller, such as website security and service improvement</li>
          <li>Consent, where required for cookies or similar technologies</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>Our website uses the following types of cookies and similar technologies:</p>

        <div class="cookie-table-wrapper">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Cookie Name</th>
                <th>Type</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
                <th>Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><code>altis_cookie_consent</code></td>
                <td>Required</td>
                <td>Stores your cookie preference</td>
                <td>1 year</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Vercel Analytics</td>
                <td>Analytics</td>
                <td>Anonymous visitor statistics; IP addresses are not stored by Altis</td>
                <td>Session</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p>You can disable or delete cookies from your browser settings. Some website functionality may be affected if cookies are disabled.</p>

        <h2>6. Data Transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Personal data is not shared with third parties unless required by law, necessary for service delivery, or based on your consent.
          We use Vercel Inc. for analytics and hosting-related services; such processing is handled within the scope of applicable data protection requirements.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Retention Period</h2>
        <p>
          Contact form data is retained for up to <strong>3 years</strong> after your request has been handled, unless a longer retention period is legally required.
          Technical log data is retained for up to <strong>90 days</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Subject to applicable law, you may have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Learn whether your personal data is being processed</li>
          <li>Request information about processed personal data</li>
          <li>Learn the purpose of processing and whether data is used in line with that purpose</li>
          <li>Know the third parties to whom data is transferred, if any</li>
          <li>Request correction of incomplete or inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request deletion or destruction of personal data where legally applicable</li>
          <li>Object to outcomes created solely through automated processing</li>
          <li>Request compensation if you suffer damage due to unlawful processing</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@altis.com.tr">info@altis.com.tr</a>.
          We will respond to applicable requests within the legally required period.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated from time to time. For material changes, the update date at the top of this page will be revised.
          Continued use of the website means you acknowledge the current version of this policy.
        </p>

        <div class="privacy-contact">
          <p>For questions:</p>
          <a href="mailto:info@altis.com.tr" class="btn btn-primary">info@altis.com.tr</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy-hero {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 72px 0 56px;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .privacy-hero .eyebrow {
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .privacy-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .hero-meta {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 48px 0 12px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .prose h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .prose li {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .prose strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--navy-700);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .prose a:hover {
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  .prose code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    background: var(--bg-blue);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .cookie-table-wrapper {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 24px 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  th, td {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  th {
    background: var(--bg-blue);
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .privacy-contact {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--bg-blue);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .privacy-contact p {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
